  "gaps": [
    "HS2-CONTROL-001: no proof lane was invoked. prior-author-lanes.mjs throws unless lane.timeoutMs===300000, but fixed-route declares 600000, and mkdir(out) runs before that check. Invoking it would reserve an incomplete allocation that blocks every later lane and stage-02. Guard and caller lanes require a passing fixed-route. The maintained-route, assessment-guard and caller proofs are therefore absent. Root must correct the control.",
    "The fixed admission test (540s) and the new guard test RC7 assessment dependency (280s) are authored but have never run, so their assertions, timing and the scripted-actor kind derivation from the Exact declared response JSON Schema prompt line are unverified.",
    "Out-of-scope test exposure, not executed: t287-native-workspace-work.test.mjs assembly owners (around lines 306 and 1113-1183) lack environment.resolvedProductLock and owner.resolution, so its assessment prepare/assembly cases are expected to refuse under the new relation. Mock leaf ports in t287-native-worksite-execution and t287-qualification-law lack admittedCatalog, so their assessment preimage returns null. Updating them needs a grant.",
    "harness.test.mjs caller lane is not exercised; the candidate caller is untested on this source.",
    "Proof reuse: retained HS02 and fixed-admission summaries (POST_AUTHOR_PROOF_INPUTS) bind the prior source digest only and give no credit to the changed owners. No acceptance claim."
  ],
